---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Alpha Digital — Premium self-published books"
description: "Premium independent books on Amazon KDP. Browse journals, planners, coloring books, and activity books designed to delight readers and convert on Amazon."
---

<section class="hero container">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Independent Publisher</p>
      <h1>Beautifully designed books that readers love — made for Amazon KDP</h1>
      <p class="lead">High-quality journals, planners, coloring books, and activity books crafted to delight readers and drive sales on Amazon. Browse our curated collection, read in-depth guides, and grab a free printable to get started.</p>
      <p class="hero-ctas">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/books/">Browse Books</a>
        <a class="btn" href="#featured">Featured</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/assets/images/hero-books.svg" alt="Stack of books illustration" width="420" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="featured" class="container featured-books">
  <h2>Featured books</h2>
  <p class="muted">Hand-picked titles to get you started.</p>
  <div class="grid books-grid">
    {% for book in collections.books | slice(0,6) %}
      {% include "book-card.njk" with { book: book } %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container browse-cats">
  <h2>Browse by category</h2>
  <div class="category-grid">
    {% for cat in collections.categories %}
      <a class="cat-card" href="/categories/{{ cat.slug }}/">
        <div class="cat-name">{{ cat.name }}</div>
        <div class="cat-count">{{ cat.items | length }} books</div>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container why-choose">
  <h2>Why choose our books?</h2>
  <div class="grid why-grid">
    <div class="why-item">
      <h3>Premium design</h3>
      <p>Thoughtful layouts, readable typography, and high-quality covers that stand out on Amazon and Pinterest.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-item">
      <h3>Practical value</h3>
      <p>Each book is created with readers in mind — practical, usable content that delivers results.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-item">
      <h3>Thoughtful marketing</h3>
      <p>SEO-optimized descriptions, pin-ready images, and focused metadata to increase discoverability on Google and Amazon.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container lead-magnet">
  <div class="lead-inner">
    <div class="lead-copy">
      <h2>Free printable planner</h2>
      <p class="lead">Join our newsletter and get a free printable planner (A4 & US Letter) — designed to help your readers plan their week and stay productive.</p>
      <form action="https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id" method="POST" class="newsletter" data-netlify="false">
        <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="/downloads/free-printable.html">
        <div class="row">
          <input name="email" type="email" placeholder="Enter your email" required>
          <button class="btn primary" type="submit">Get the printable</button>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted">We respect your privacy. No spam; unsubscribe anytime.</p>
      </form>
    </div>
    <div class="lead-media" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/assets/images/printable-preview.svg" alt="Printable preview" width="360" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container latest-posts">
  <h2>Latest from the blog</h2>
  <div class="grid posts-grid">
    {% for post in collections.posts | slice(0,3) %}
      <article class="post-card">
        <a href="{{ post.url }}"><h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3></a>
        <p class="muted small">{{ post.data.date | date("MMMM d, yyyy") }}</p>
        <p class="card-meta">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
      </article>
    {% else %}
      <p class="muted">No posts yet — blog content will appear here once added.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p><a class="btn" href="/blog/">Read the blog</a></p>
</section>
